#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`lsm6dsox` --- LSM6DSOX 6-axis IMU"
msgstr ":mod:`lsm6dsox` --- LSM6DSOX 6 軸 IMU"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:7
msgid ""
"Driver for the ST LSM6DSOX iNEMO 6-axis inertial measurement unit (3-axis "
"accelerometer plus 3-axis gyroscope) over I2C or SPI. In addition to the "
"basic IMU output, the driver exposes the on-chip embedded functions: a "
"configurable pedometer (step counter) and the Machine Learning Core (MLC), "
"which can be programmed via UCF files exported from ST's Unico-GUI tool."
msgstr ""
"透過 I2C 或 SPI 操作 ST LSM6DSOX iNEMO 6 軸慣性量測單元（3 軸加速度計加 3 軸陀螺儀）的驅動程式。除了基本的 IMU "
"輸出之外，此驅動程式也提供晶片內建的嵌入式功能：可設定的計步器（步數計數器）以及機器學習核心（MLC），後者可透過從 ST Unico-GUI "
"工具匯出的 UCF 檔案進行程式設定。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:14
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "範例::"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:33
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "類別"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:37
msgid ""
"Construct an ``LSM6DSOX`` instance. The bus type is auto-detected: if "
"``bus`` exposes ``readfrom_mem`` it is treated as a :py:class:`machine.I2C`,"
" otherwise it is treated as a :py:class:`machine.SPI` and ``cs`` must be "
"supplied. The chip is soft-reset, the requested ODR and scale are "
"programmed, and an MLC UCF file is loaded if provided."
msgstr ""
"建構一個 ``LSM6DSOX`` 實例。匯流排類型會自動偵測：若 ``bus`` 提供 ``readfrom_mem``\\ ，則視為 "
":py:class:`machine.I2C`\\ ，否則視為 :py:class:`machine.SPI` 且必須提供 ``cs``\\ "
"。晶片會被軟體重置，所要求的 ODR 與量程會被設定，若有提供 MLC UCF 檔案則會載入。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:43
msgid "``bus``"
msgstr "``bus``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:44
msgid ""
"Either a configured :py:class:`machine.I2C` or :py:class:`machine.SPI` bus."
msgstr "已設定的 :py:class:`machine.I2C` 或 :py:class:`machine.SPI` 匯流排。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:47
msgid "``cs``"
msgstr "``cs``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:48
msgid ""
"Chip-select :py:class:`machine.Pin` used in SPI mode. Required when ``bus`` "
"is an SPI instance, ignored otherwise."
msgstr ""
"SPI 模式下使用的晶片選擇 :py:class:`machine.Pin`\\ 。當 ``bus`` 為 SPI 實例時必須提供，否則會被忽略。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:51
msgid "``address``"
msgstr "``address``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:52
msgid ""
"7-bit I2C address of the device. Defaults to ``0x6A``; some boards strap the"
" SDO pin high which selects ``0x6B``."
msgstr "裝置的 7 位元 I2C 位址。預設為 ``0x6A``\\ ；某些主機板會將 SDO 接腳拉高，此時會選擇 ``0x6B``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:55
msgid "``gyro_odr``"
msgstr "``gyro_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:56
msgid ""
"Gyroscope output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``0`` (off), ``1.6``, "
"``3.33``, ``6.66``, ``12.5``, ``26``, ``52``, ``104``, ``208``, ``416`` or "
"``888``."
msgstr ""
"陀螺儀的輸出資料速率，以 Hz 為單位。必須為 ``0``\\ （關閉）、\\ ``1.6``\\ 、\\ ``3.33``\\ 、\\ "
"``6.66``\\ 、\\ ``12.5``\\ 、\\ ``26``\\ 、\\ ``52``\\ 、\\ ``104``\\ 、\\ "
"``208``\\ 、\\ ``416`` 或 ``888`` 其中之一。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:60
msgid "``accel_odr``"
msgstr "``accel_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:61
msgid ""
"Accelerometer output data rate in Hz. Same set of values as ``gyro_odr``."
msgstr "加速度計的輸出資料速率，以 Hz 為單位。與 ``gyro_odr`` 為相同的數值集合。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:64
msgid "``gyro_scale``"
msgstr "``gyro_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:65
msgid ""
"Gyroscope full-scale range in degrees-per-second. Must be one of ``250``, "
"``500``, ``1000`` or ``2000``."
msgstr "陀螺儀的全量程範圍，以每秒度數為單位。必須為 ``250``\\ 、\\ ``500``\\ 、\\ ``1000`` 或 ``2000`` 其中之一。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:68
msgid "``accel_scale``"
msgstr "``accel_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:69
msgid ""
"Accelerometer full-scale range in g. Must be one of ``2``, ``4``, ``8`` or "
"``16``."
msgstr "加速度計的全量程範圍，以 g 為單位。必須為 ``2``\\ 、\\ ``4``\\ 、\\ ``8`` 或 ``16`` 其中之一。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:72
msgid "``ucf``"
msgstr "``ucf``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:73
msgid ""
"Optional path to an ST Unico-GUI ``.ucf`` register-dump file. If supplied "
"the file is parsed and applied to the MLC during construction by way of "
":meth:`load_mlc`."
msgstr ""
"指向 ST Unico-GUI ``.ucf`` 暫存器傾印檔的選用路徑。若有提供，該檔案會在建構期間被剖析並透過 :meth:`load_mlc` "
"套用至 MLC。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:79
msgid ""
"Issue a software reset via ``CTRL3_C`` and block until the reset bit clears."
" Raises ``OSError`` if the device fails to come back within ten retries."
msgstr "透過 ``CTRL3_C`` 發出軟體重置並阻擋直到重置位元清除為止。若裝置在十次重試內未能恢復，則引發 ``OSError``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:85
msgid ""
"Switch the FUNC_CFG register bank. Used internally to access the embedded "
"function and sensor-hub register pages; rarely needed by application code."
msgstr "切換 FUNC_CFG 暫存器庫。在內部用於存取嵌入式功能與感測器集線器的暫存器頁面；應用程式碼鮮少需要用到。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:91
msgid ""
"Enable or disable the embedded-function block. When ``enable`` is ``True`` "
"the two-byte ``emb_ab`` tuple is written to "
"``EMB_FUNC_EN_A``/``EMB_FUNC_EN_B``. When ``False`` the current values are "
"read, the MLC/pedometer enable bits are cleared, and the previous values are"
" returned so they can be restored later."
msgstr ""
"啟用或停用嵌入式功能區塊。當 ``enable`` 為 ``True`` 時，兩位元組的 ``emb_ab`` 元組會寫入 "
"``EMB_FUNC_EN_A``/``EMB_FUNC_EN_B``\\ 。當為 ``False`` 時，會讀取目前值，清除 "
"MLC/計步器啟用位元，並傳回先前的值以便日後還原。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:99
msgid ""
"Apply an MLC UCF program from the file at path ``ucf``. The driver walks the"
" file line-by-line, applies each ``Ac <reg> <val>`` write, then enables BDU,"
" routes MLC events to interrupt pin 1 and turns the embedded functions back "
"on."
msgstr ""
"從位於路徑 ``ucf`` 的檔案套用 MLC UCF 程式。驅動程式會逐行走訪檔案、套用每個 ``Ac <reg> <val>`` 寫入，接著啟用 "
"BDU、將 MLC 事件繞送至中斷接腳 1 並重新開啟嵌入式功能。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:106
msgid ""
"If new MLC results are available (``MLC_STATUS`` bit set), return the "
"contents of the eight ``MLC0_SRC..MLC7_SRC`` registers as a bytes-like "
"object. Otherwise return ``None``."
msgstr ""
"若有新的 MLC 結果可用（\\ ``MLC_STATUS`` 位元已設定），則將八個 ``MLC0_SRC..MLC7_SRC`` "
"暫存器的內容以類位元組物件傳回。否則傳回 ``None``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:112
msgid "Configure the embedded pedometer."
msgstr "設定嵌入式計步器。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:114
msgid "``enable``"
msgstr "``enable``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:115
msgid "Enables or disables step detection on the embedded function block."
msgstr "啟用或停用嵌入式功能區塊上的步數偵測。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:117
msgid "``debounce``"
msgstr "``debounce``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:118
msgid "Step debounce value written into ``PEDO_DEB_STEPS_CONF``."
msgstr "寫入 ``PEDO_DEB_STEPS_CONF`` 的步數去抖動值。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:120
msgid "``int1_enable``"
msgstr "``int1_enable``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:121
msgid "If ``True``, route pedometer events to the ``INT1`` pin."
msgstr "若為 ``True``\\ ，將計步器事件繞送至 ``INT1`` 接腳。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:123
msgid "``int2_enable``"
msgstr "``int2_enable``"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:124
msgid "If ``True``, route pedometer events to the ``INT2`` pin."
msgstr "若為 ``True``\\ ，將計步器事件繞送至 ``INT2`` 接腳。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:128
msgid "Reset the step counter back to zero."
msgstr "將步數計數器重設回零。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:132
msgid "Return the current value of the 16-bit step counter."
msgstr "傳回 16 位元步數計數器的目前值。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:136
msgid "Return the gyroscope vector ``(x, y, z)`` in degrees per second."
msgstr "傳回陀螺儀向量 ``(x, y, z)``\\ ，以每秒度數為單位。"

#: ../../library/lsm6dsox.rst:140
msgid ""
"Return the acceleration vector ``(x, y, z)`` in units of standard gravity (1"
" g = 9.81 m/s²)."
msgstr "傳回加速度向量 ``(x, y, z)``\\ ，以標準重力為單位（1 g = 9.81 m/s²）。"
